        "text": "The presence of posterior shadowing is not a definitive indicator of malignancy. This feature can also be seen in benign lesions, such as lipomas and simple cysts, which have an echogenic pseudocapsule. The echogenic pseudocapsule is a benign posterior feature descriptor, supporting a benign interpretation",
